# Contact Form Email Backend Configuration
# -------------------------------------------------------------
# Recommended: Formspree (Instant setup for direct delivery to jyothsnaangadi7@gmail.com)
# 1. Create a free account at https://formspree.io using jyothsnaangadi7@gmail.com
# 2. Create a new form with target recipient jyothsnaangadi7@gmail.com
# 3. Confirm the verification email sent by Formspree to your inbox
# 4. Copy your Form ID (e.g. mqkndpqr) and replace YOUR_FORM_ID below:
VITE_FORMSPREE_ENDPOINT=https://formspree.io/f/YOUR_FORM_ID

# Alternative: EmailJS (if you prefer EmailJS over Formspree)
# VITE_EMAILJS_SERVICE_ID=
# VITE_EMAILJS_TEMPLATE_ID=
# VITE_EMAILJS_PUBLIC_KEY=
